# Portfolio Website

A responsive personal portfolio website built with **HTML**, **CSS**, and **Vanilla JavaScript**. All portfolio information is managed through a single `config.json` file, making it easy to update without modifying the HTML pages.

---

## ✨ Features

* Fully Responsive Portfolio Website
* One-page Resume (Printable PDF)
* Multi-page Portfolio (Printable PDF)
* Dynamic Content rendering from `data/config.json`
* Dark Mode Support
* No Frameworks or Heavy Dependencies
* GitHub Pages Ready
* Print-friendly CSS Layout

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
portfolio/
│
├── index.html          # Main Portfolio Website
├── resume.html         # Printable One-page Resume
├── portfolio.html      # Detailed Portfolio
│
├── css/
│   └── style.css       # Main Stylesheet (Includes Dark Mode & Print styles)
│
├── js/
│   └── render.js       # Core Script (Loads config.json and renders DOM)
│
├── data/
│   └── config.json     # Personal Data & Website Settings
│
├── assets/
